# Library/UI contracts

- Imports follow `core → dom/object/veela/uniform → lure|ssre → style-lib → fl.ui/apps`; lower layers never import higher ones. `ssre` is backend HTML and must not import `lure` or `dom`.
- Token defaults emit only from veela `core/misc/_tokens.scss`. Consumers override context or use `var(--token, fallback)`. Contract: `.cursor/rules/design-tokens.mdc`. Implementer/mapper: `.cursor/rules/model-pair.mdc`.
- Reuse LUR.E `TriggerCore`: `once`/`debounce`/`prevent`/`stop`/`capture`/`passive`, `withTriggerModifiers`, `refTrigger`, and `E({ on })` handler-modifier tuples; preserve `EventListenerObject` handlers.
- Use `bindOutsideDismiss` for transient surfaces: composed paths, panel roots, exception nodes/selectors/predicates, Escape, and idempotent cleanup. Keep `makeClickOutsideTrigger` and `makeInterruptTrigger` compatible.
- Use `resolveOverlayHost` and `registerTransientOverlay`; same-kind overlays close LIFO via fractional ordering without changing priority bands.
- Use `resolvePlacement` / `placeOverlay` with CSS-anchor-to-JS fallback and the fixed client viewport descriptor from `dom.ts`.
- `datasetLink` is bidirectional; `stylePropLink` / `cssVarLink` are ref→DOM. Use their `datasetRef` / `stylePropRef` / `cssVarRef` helpers.
- Form controls use `formLink` / `selectLink` or `FormBinding` (`bindFormControl`, `formRef`) for text, number, checked, radio, and select; mount lifecycle stays opt-in through `bindWhileConnected`.
- Unified ContextMenu preserves placement/host/transient session cleanup. ChromeFlyout keeps fixed Win11 placement, Calendar/QS exclusivity, `bindOutsideDismiss`, and one per-session back entry; do not re-register it in `overlay-back`.
- `openModal` is document-body native-dialog-first with controlled fallback, focus restore, transient LIFO close, and bundled `ui-modal-*` styles. Do not bulk-migrate ShortcutEditor or legacy callers.
- Speed Dial keeps icon and label layers separate over shared persisted cells; sync the active workspace snapshot for every add/update/remove, including Network deletion. An explicitly empty stored grid prevents legacy re-import.
- New overlay UI (menu, modal, toast, tooltip, prompt) consumes veela tokens + LUR.E `TriggerCore` / `bindOutsideDismiss` / `resolvePlacement`. Do not emit a second `:root` palette or unlayered `--color-*`.
- Defer date/time/color/file controls; tooltip/prompt/toast consolidation; anchor-relative ChromeFlyout; key/outside/gesture expansion; S/bindStyle + Typed OM/Houdini/WAAPI; production editor migrations; env-shell duplicate-tree consolidation.
- Verification is targeted only: `modules/projects/lur.e/package.json` `npm test` runs linker/interaction/placement/overlay-host/trigger-core/form-binding; FL-UI browser paths are `test/{workspace-snapshot,modal-lifecycle,chrome-flyout-lifecycle,form-binding-lifecycle}.test.ts` and `test/{playground,suites/{forms,modal,overlays}}.ts`. Do not claim a monorepo build or deploy passed.
